* edge fed microstrip patch antenna, 2.45 GHz, terminated by a pml
* mesh: gmsh -3 -format msh22 -o patch.msh patch.geo
mesh patch.msh
mat sub eps 2.2 tand 0.001
mat sub_pml eps 2.2 tand 0.001
pml sub_pml 3 3 3
pml air_pml 3 3 3
pec pec
port 1 feed 0 0 1 200
sweep lin 2.1e9 2.8e9 15
field patch.vtk 2.45e9
